#: internal/cli/auth.go:24
msgid ""
"Manage authentication credentials for all AI providers.\n"
"\n"
"OAuth providers (interactive browser/device flow):\n"
"  github-copilot GitHub Copilot (device code flow)\n"
"  gemini        Google Gemini CLI (browser OAuth)\n"
"\n"
"Multi-method providers:\n"
"  openai        OpenAI (browser OAuth, device code, or API key)\n"
"\n"
"API key providers (paste your key):\n"
"  google        Google AI Studio (Gemini API key)\n"
"  groq          Groq Cloud\n"
"  opencode      OpenCode Zen API\n"
"  custom-openai Custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint\n"
"\n"
"No auth required:\n"
"  ollama        Local Ollama server\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"  lokit auth login                         Interactive provider selection\n"
"  lokit auth login --provider github-copilot OAuth with GitHub Copilot\n"
"  lokit auth login --provider openai       Choose OpenAI auth method\n"
"  lokit auth login --provider openai --headless\n"
"  lokit auth login --provider google       Store Google AI API key\n"
"  lokit auth logout --provider google      Remove Google API key\n"
"  lokit auth logout                        Remove all credentials\n"
"  lokit auth list                          Show all stored credentials"
msgstr ""
"Gérez les identifiants d’authentification pour tous les fournisseurs d’IA.\n"
"\n"
"Fournisseurs OAuth (flux interactif navigateur/appareil) :\n"
"  github-copilot GitHub Copilot (flux code appareil)\n"
"  gemini        Google Gemini CLI (OAuth navigateur)\n"
"\n"
"Fournisseurs multi-méthodes :\n"
"  openai        OpenAI (OAuth navigateur, code appareil ou clé API)\n"
"\n"
"Fournisseurs par clé API (collez votre clé) :\n"
"  google        Google AI Studio (clé API Gemini)\n"
"  groq          Groq Cloud\n"
"  opencode      OpenCode Zen API\n"
"  custom-openai Endpoint compatible OpenAI personnalisé\n"
"\n"
"Aucune authentification requise :\n"
"  ollama        Serveur Ollama local\n"
"\n"
"Exemples :\n"
"  lokit auth login                         Sélection interactive du fournisseur\n"
"  lokit auth login --provider github-copilot OAuth avec GitHub Copilot\n"
"  lokit auth login --provider openai       Choisir la méthode d’auth OpenAI\n"
"  lokit auth login --provider openai --headless\n"
"  lokit auth login --provider google       Enregistrer la clé API Google AI\n"
"  lokit auth logout --provider google      Supprimer la clé API Google\n"
"  lokit auth logout                        Supprimer tous les identifiants\n"
"  lokit auth list                          Afficher tous les identifiants enregistrés"

