#: internal/cli/root.go:281
msgid "Localization Kit: AI-powered translation for multiple formats"
msgstr "Localization Kit : traduction assistée par IA pour de multiples formats"

#: internal/cli/root.go:282
msgid ""
"lokit — Localization Kit: AI-powered translation for multiple formats.\n"
"\n"
"Supported target formats configured via lokit.yaml:\n"
"  gettext     Flat (po/*.po) and nested (po/lang/*.po) PO files\n"
"  po4a        Documentation translation (man pages, groff/roff markup)\n"
"  i18next     Flat JSON translation files (key-value map)\n"
"  vue-i18n    Nested JSON translation files\n"
"  android     Android strings.xml resource files\n"
"  yaml        YAML translation files\n"
"  markdown    Markdown document translation\n"
"  properties  Java .properties translation files\n"
"  flutter     Flutter ARB (Application Resource Bundle) files\n"
"  js-kv       JavaScript assignment key-value translation files\n"
"  desktop     freedesktop desktop entry translations\n"
"  polkit      PolicyKit XML policy translations\n"
"\n"
"Configuration:\n"
"  Project settings are defined in lokit.yaml at the project root.\n"
"  Each project can have multiple translation targets with different formats.\n"
"  See project examples for lokit.yaml format.\n"
"\n"
"AI Providers:\n"
"  google         Google AI (Gemini) — API key\n"
"  gemini         Gemini CLI — browser OAuth\n"
"  groq           Groq — API key required\n"
"  opencode       OpenCode Zen API — API key (optional)\n"
"  github-copilot GitHub Copilot — native OAuth\n"
"  openai         OpenAI — browser OAuth, device code, or API key\n"
"  ollama         Ollama local server\n"
"  custom-openai  Custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint"
msgstr ""
"lokit — Localization Kit : traduction assistée par IA pour de multiples formats.\n"
"\n"
"Formats cibles pris en charge, configurés via lokit.yaml :\n"
"  gettext     Fichiers PO plats (po/*.po) et imbriqués (po/lang/*.po)\n"
"  po4a        Traduction de documentation (pages man, balisage groff/roff)\n"
"  i18next     Fichiers JSON plats (clé-valeur)\n"
"  vue-i18n    Fichiers JSON imbriqués\n"
"  android     Fichiers de ressources Android strings.xml\n"
"  yaml        Fichiers de traduction YAML\n"
"  markdown    Traduction de documents Markdown\n"
"  properties  Fichiers de propriétés Java (.properties)\n"
"  flutter     Fichiers ARB Flutter (Application Resource Bundle)\n"
"  js-kv       Fichiers de traduction JavaScript clé-valeur\n"
"  desktop     Traductions de fichiers desktop freedesktop\n"
"  polkit      Traductions de politiques PolicyKit XML\n"
"\n"
"Configuration :\n"
"  Les paramètres du projet sont définis dans lokit.yaml à la racine du projet.\n"
"  Chaque projet peut avoir plusieurs cibles de traduction avec des formats différents.\n"
"  Consultez les exemples de projet pour le format lokit.yaml.\n"
"\n"
"Fournisseurs IA :\n"
"  google         Google AI (Gemini) — clé API\n"
"  gemini         Gemini CLI — OAuth navigateur\n"
"  groq           Groq — clé API requise\n"
"  opencode       OpenCode Zen API — clé API (optionnelle)\n"
"  github-copilot GitHub Copilot — OAuth natif\n"
"  openai         OpenAI — OAuth navigateur, code appareil ou clé API\n"
"  ollama         Serveur Ollama local\n"
"  custom-openai  Endpoint compatible OpenAI personnalisé"

